This repository contains original Android integration code and patches.

- dhewm3: GPLv3 — https://github.com/dhewm/dhewm3
- SDL2: zlib license — https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL
- GL4ES: MIT — https://github.com/ptitSeb/gl4es
- OpenAL Soft: LGPLv2+ — https://github.com/kcat/openal-soft

Original Doom 3 game data (*.pk4) is NOT included and remains property of
id Software / Bethesda. You must own a legal copy of Doom 3 to play.
